  "What's the best piece of advice you've ever received?",
  "What's the strangest job you had before consulting?",
  "What's a non-obvious skill that has helped you more than expected in your career?",
  "What's the most unusual thing you've ever eaten?",
  "What's a totally underrated simple pleasure?",
  "What was your childhood dream job?",
  "What's a random fact you know that impresses people at parties?",
